# Auto Service module map

**Acceptance SSOT:** [Auto-Acceptance-System](../../../docs/acceptance/Auto-Acceptance-System.md) · [Product-Readiness](../../../docs/acceptance/Auto-Product-Readiness-Matrix.md) · edition [`docs/editions/auto.yaml`](../../../docs/editions/auto.yaml)

| Domain | API prefix | Notes |
|--------|------------|-------|
| Auth / SSO | `app/api/auth/` | local + SSO |
| Work orders | `app/api/work-orders/` | intake, labor, parts, pay, complete, shop-floor |
| Vehicles | `app/api/vehicles/` | history |
| Appointments | `app/api/appointments/` | scheduling |
| Parts | `parts/catalog` | catalog |
| Tools | `app/api/tools/` | checkout |
| Calendar | `app/api/calendar/` | bay calendar |
| MDM | `mdm/voen-lookup` | counterparty |
| Cron | `cron/service-due` | reminders; `runCronForEachTenant` (SHARED: orch pool registry, 503 when unavailable; DEDICATED/ONPREM: process org) → `byOrganization` |
| Events | `events/dispatch` | orchestrator |
| Internal | `GET/POST /api/internal/v1/organization/bind`, `GET/POST /api/internal/v1/runtime-config` | Orch Sync bind + desired-state config; `instrumentation` boot |

**Tenancy (CP-TENANT-01):** `organizationId` on tenant/ops models + kit Prisma extension + `requireSatelliteModule("industry_auto_service")` (AC-AUTO-TENANT 🟡 — not live SHARED pool).

| Access matrix (AS-RBAC-01) | `app/api/admin/roles`, `admin/roles/[code]`, `admin/roles/[code]/permissions`, `api/internal/v1/workforce/roles`, `admin/users`, `auth/me`, `auth/session/refresh-permissions`, `auth/logout`; page `/admin/access` | `Role` (`isSystem`, `cloneFromCode`, `permissionCatalogVersion`), `SatelliteAuditLog`; catalog `src/lib/auth/permissions.ts`; page map `page-route-permissions.ts`; API map `api-route-permissions.ts` |

**RBAC Variant A (AS-RBAC-01):** `getSatelliteSession()` also builds `permissions` from the role row and checks the stamped API path against `api-route-permissions.ts` (unlisted → 403). Pages: middleware `authorizePage` + `page-route-permissions.ts`. A new staff route or page needs a catalog row in the same change. `/api/cron/service-due` is a declared handler exception (`PLATFORM_CRON_SECRET`), not a staff grant. ADR auto-domain-permissions-and-rbac.

## Platform billing status

`GET /api/platform/billing-status` — `app/api/platform/billing-status/route.ts` re-exports `@era/satellite-kit/billing/status-route` (banner in `EraAppRouteShell`). Staff calls the orchestrator denies (SOFT_BLOCK export, HARD_BLOCK write) get 402 from kit `readSatelliteStaffSession`; `handleRouteError` returns `{ error, code, billingStatus }`. ADR `docs/adr/billing-enforcement-satellites.md`.
